~ go_here_button_forest
do emit_change_character_portrait("AngelNeutral")
Angel: Ooh a forest! Should we check this place out?
- Yeah => positive_response
- Nah => negative_response
=> END

~ positive_response
do emit_change_character_portrait("AngelHappy")
Angel: Woo! Let's gooooo!
=> END

~ negative_response
do emit_change_character_portrait("AngelSad")
Angel: Aww...okay, maybe another time...
=> END